\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord of the living harvest
\par That whitens o'er the plain,
\par Where angels soon shall gather
\par Their sheaves of golden grain,
\par Accept these hands to labour,
\par These hearts to trust and love,
\par And deign with them to hasten
\par Thy kingdom from above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. As labourers is Thy vineyard,
\par Lord, send them out to be,
\par Content to bear the burden
\par Of weary days for Thee,
\par Content to ask no wages
\par When Thou shalt call them home.
\par But to have shared the travail
\par That makes Thy kingdom come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Be with them, God the Father,
\par Be with them, God the Son,
\par Be with them, God the Spirit,
\par Eternal Three in one!
\par Make them a royal priesthood,
\par Thee rightly to adore,
\par And fill them with Thy fullness
\par Now and for evermore. Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

